(7666805, 1250847, 42733, '<td valign="top">I like these shapes. I wouldn''t have thought of this as a subject, but I think it works.</td>', 'I like these shapes. I wouldn''t have thought of this as a subject, but I think it works.', '2020-06-18 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666813, 1250917, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s something just so artful about this.  I''m not typically on the same wavelength with abstract photography, but I really love this!  It''s so interesting and well done.  I can see it printed very large hanging on a wall.</td>', 'There''s something just so artful about this.  I''m not typically on the same wavelength with abstract photography, but I really love this!  It''s so interesting and well done.  I can see it printed very large hanging on a wall.', '2020-06-18 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666814, 1250912, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the inclusion of the shadowy people in front of the building.  The light is absolutely perfect.  Enough to see the detail... but not too much to give it an elegant night time look.</td>', 'I love the inclusion of the shadowy people in front of the building.  The light is absolutely perfect.  Enough to see the detail... but not too much to give it an elegant night time look.', '2020-06-18 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
