(7666816, 1250863, 24454, '<td valign="top">Gasp!  Ohhhhhmygoodness!  This is amazing!  As a perpetual "attempter" at hummingbird photos, what I appreciate so much about this is how totally sharp every part of the image is... and in such low light.</td>', 'Gasp!  Ohhhhhmygoodness!  This is amazing!  As a perpetual "attempter" at hummingbird photos, what I appreciate so much about this is how totally sharp every part of the image is... and in such low light.', '2020-06-18 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
