(7666827, 1250607, 24454, '<td valign="top">Is this my 2nd favorite Vizsla???  Wow!  What an art piece!  He is SUCH a gooood boy!  Especially with some birds there on the beach that he is not chasing.  My favorite photo so far... but I know I''m emotionally biased.  It''s beautiful!  <br/> <br/>I just finished voting... and tho there are some wonderful images.  This is my "Best in Show", so it is getting my only 10  :)</td>', 'Is this my 2nd favorite Vizsla???  Wow!  What an art piece!  He is SUCH a gooood boy!  Especially with some birds there on the beach that he is not chasing.  My favorite photo so far... but I know I''m emotionally biased.  It''s beautiful!   I just finished voting... and tho there are some wonderful images.  This is my "Best in Show", so it is getting my only 10  :)', '2020-06-18 20:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667102, 1250863, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. I am dying to know the technical specs on this. Getting that level of detail in a flying Hummer in low light boggles my mind.</td>', 'Stunning image. I am dying to know the technical specs on this. Getting that level of detail in a flying Hummer in low light boggles my mind.', '2020-06-19 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667103, 1250863, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great shot of this little lady. Im guessing you got this just before dark with flash. The hummers seem a little less timid at this time of day maybe because they are filling up for the evening or maybe their vision is reduced as evening falls. I read an interesting article on their ability to see color in the ultraviolet range. Much better than humans.</td>', 'Great shot of this little lady. Im guessing you got this just before dark with flash. The hummers seem a little less timid at this time of day maybe because they are filling up for the evening or maybe their vision is reduced as evening falls. I read an interesting article on their ability to see color in the ultraviolet range. Much better than humans.', '2020-06-19 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667104, 1250879, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the little bit of light, and the subject suits the darkness. Or the darkness suits the subject.</td>', 'Love the little bit of light, and the subject suits the darkness. Or the darkness suits the subject.', '2020-06-19 16:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667107, 1250420, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is along the lines of what I was expecting in this challenge. Soft, low light which nonetheless lets us see the subject clearly. Well done.</td>', 'This is along the lines of what I was expecting in this challenge. Soft, low light which nonetheless lets us see the subject clearly. Well done.', '2020-06-19 16:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667108, 1250751, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s an amazing capture!</td>', 'That''s an amazing capture!', '2020-06-19 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667110, 1250901, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but it looks like duotone to me, which isn''t what I thought the challenge was about. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Interesting image, but it looks like duotone to me, which isn''t what I thought the challenge was about. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2020-06-19 16:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
